text: Sunburn Speedway is a 3D desert kart sprint where you grab sun pickups, hold SPACE to cook boost power, and zig-zag through palm shade to vent heat before you spin out.

Drive with WASD or arrows, bounce cacti for speed, hit every checkpoint, and cross the finish before the 90-second clock ends.
